*.db
*.sqlite3
models/hinglish/checkpoints/
models/hinglish/*.gguf

# --- Scratch/draft notes some editors or habits leave behind — never the
# --- project's real docs (README.md, docs/*.md, CLAUDE_CODE_PROJECT_CONTEXT.md,
# --- evaluation/experiments/rubric_prompt.md are all tracked deliberately).
NOTES.md
TODO.md
SCRATCH.md
DRAFT*.md
*.draft.md

# NOTE: data/samples/*.jsonl and evaluation/reports/*.json are intentionally
# NOT ignored — they're the frozen dataset and the evaluation evidence a
# panelist reviews directly. *.db (the audit trail) stays ignored: it's a
# large, non-diff-friendly binary that accumulates across every dev run and
# regenerates in seconds (`python scripts/run_system_eval.py`); the JSON/
# JSONL reports already capture its evidence in reviewable form.

*.md
!/README.md